<title>USA: Reuter Manufacturing Inc Q4 net vs loss.</title>
<headline>Reuter Manufacturing Inc Q4 net vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HOPKINS, Minn. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary profit	 $0.10     loss	 $0.24</p>
<p> Net profit		     351     loss	   781</p>
<p> Revs			   4,056		    2,297</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	   3,462		    3,192</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	   6,640		    3,192</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 includes loss from discontinued operations of $540,131 or $0.17/shr.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 on a diluted basis was a shr profit of $0.05.</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary profit	 $2.36     loss	 $0.87</p>
<p> Net profit		   7,999     loss	 2,768</p>
<p> Revs			  14,174		   11,052</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	   3,385		    3,192</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	   5,242		    3,192</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year results include gain of $7.2 million or $2.14/shr ($1.38/shr diluted) on restructuring debt.</p>
<p>1995 year results include loss from discontinued operations of $2.2 million or $0.68/shr.</p>
<p>1996 year on a diluted basis was a shr profit of $1.52.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
